            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "The basic treatment of radiation in AGCM3 is similar to GCM2 in that solar radiation is treated following Fouquart and Bonnel (1980) and terrestrial radiation following Morcrette (1989).",
