            "paragraph": "The most significant change involves the treatment of the water vapour continuum. In GCM2, the Roberts (1976) parameterization for water vapour continuum was used. In AGCM3 this has been replaced by the newer scheme of Zhong and Haigh (1995), which is based on version 2.2 of Clough et al. (1989), often referred to as CDK2.2.",
